                <note rend="inline" type="source">798.94/5471: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China (Johnson)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-08-06T16:00:00-04:00">August 6, 1932—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>243. Your 905, August 6, 11 a.m. Have you discussed this with your military staff
                    and with your diplomatic colleagues? What are their opinions?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
